### What About Time and Space Complexity?

The worst-case time is O(m * n * 4^L) where L is the maximum word length. However, the Trie pruning makes the practical cost far smaller because dead prefixes are abandoned immediately. The space is O(total characters in dictionary) for the Trie plus O(L) for the recursion stack.

